    answer: "Yes. We integrate into your existing workflows and tools rather than operating as a black box. Many clients treat us as an embedded engineering team for AI development, custom software, and ongoing product work, not a one-off vendor."
  - question: "What industries and project types does Zunkiree Labs take on globally?"
    answer: "We work across healthcare, manufacturing, legal, professional services, education, human resources, and real estate — and take on new industries beyond that list where our AI and software expertise applies. Project types range from AI development and custom software to SaaS platforms, data systems, AI ecommerce, AI customer experience (including Voice AI), and AEO/SEO."
  - question: "How do I get started with a global engagement?"
    answer: "Start with a discovery call. We'll scope your project, agree on milestones, and set up the communication cadence that works across your time zone. Most engagements launch within 1-2 weeks of the initial call."
